WEBVTT

00:00:00.181 --> 00:00:09.524
Hi there, and welcome to Bite Wise! Local restaurants post their surplus food, like wrong orders and end-of-day extras, at up to seventy percent off.

00:00:09.827 --> 00:00:13.560
Create a free account, then log in with your email or user name.

00:00:14.331 --> 00:00:19.024
You'll see live deals near you, with a countdown showing how long each one is available.

00:00:19.325 --> 00:00:22.141
Search by dish, restaurant, city, or ZIP code.

00:00:22.442 --> 00:00:24.662
Pick a deal, and choose how many you want.

00:00:25.392 --> 00:00:31.153
You see the full total before you order: the food, a small service fee, and any applicable taxes.

00:00:31.455 --> 00:00:35.636
Use your Bite Wise credit, and pay the rest with a saved or new card.

00:00:37.464 --> 00:00:41.453
Your card is only held for now. It's charged when you pick up your food.

00:00:42.626 --> 00:00:46.358
Done! You get a four-digit PIN. Show it at the counter when you pick up.

00:00:48.402 --> 00:00:51.303
Your orders and PINs are always under My orders.

00:00:52.875 --> 00:00:56.288
And every order comes with a receipt you can print or download.

00:00:58.097 --> 00:01:02.705
That's Bite Wise. Rescue great food, and save money. Happy rescuing!
